  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"663\">\n<p data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"663\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Detects <strong data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"633\">IgG antibodies</strong> against <em data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"654\">Leptospira</em> species.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"755\">\n<p data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"755\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">A <strong data-start=\"668\" data-end=\"687\">positive result</strong> suggests <strong data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"715\">past infection</strong> or <strong data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"754\">late-phase of current infection</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"827\">\n<p data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"827\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">May indicate <strong data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"797\">exposure to Leptospira</strong> or <strong data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"826\">chronic carrier state</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"914\">\n<p data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"914\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Should be interpreted with clinical symptoms and <strong data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"886\">IgM</strong> result for acute infection.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
